    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Reshaping inputs into CNN format**\n",
        "\n",
        "This code reshapes inputs from a long vector into the shape of the diagram.\n",
        "Before (N, l*4) to (N, L, 4)\n",
        "\n",
        "Where L = positions in the DNA window\n",
        "\n",
        "4 = Channels for A/C/G/T"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "o6b9qTa_2MSY"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "X_train = x_train.reshape((-1, Length, 4))\n",
        "X_test  = x_test.reshape((-1, Length, 4))\n",
        "\n",
        "if y_train.ndim == 1:\n",
        "    y_train_oh = tf.keras.utils.to_categorical(y_train.astype(int), num_classes=3)\n",
        "    y_test_oh  = tf.keras.utils.to_categorical(y_test.astype(int),  num_classes=3)\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    y_train_oh, y_test_oh = y_train, y_test\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"X_train:\", X_train.shape, \"y_train:\", y_train_oh.shape)\n",
        "print(\"X_test :\", X_test.shape,  \"y_test :\", y_test_oh.shape)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "_9cRJVrX2ms-",
        "outputId": "f164e78c-a8a0-4a82-8877-e820fffe2151"
      },
      "execution_count": 4,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "X_train: (24000, 100, 4) y_train: (24000, 3)\n",
            "X_test : (6000, 100, 4) y_test : (6000, 3)\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
